License, Version 1.1 (full text next to the files). Only the Latin (Jost, Cormorant Garamond)
and Devanagari (Noto Sans Devanagari) subsets were taken, as published in the @fontsource npm
packages v5.3.0; the font names and files are otherwise unchanged.

